    "directions": [
      "Parboil the potatoes in salted water and drain them and keep aside.",
      "While the potatoes are hot press them in between your palms to flatten them.",
      "Now heat oil in a frying pan and fry the potatoes till the skin becomes nice crispy and turns golden brown in colour.",
      "Fry and remove on an absorbent paper to drain off the excess oil.",
      "Now take a bowl and add in anardana powder, red chilli powder, chaat masala, salt and black pepper powder. Mix well.",
      "Now add in the hot potatoes in the bowl and toss them well in the masalas.",
      "Remove and serve hot."
    ],
